                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#212121' fontname='Roboto'>Fraud</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#212121' fontname='Roboto'> = Based on Fraud Labels on DH Incentive Fraud Squad</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#212121' fontname='Roboto'>For every orders evaluated by EC Voucher fraud tool, and has allowed the redemption, we get the flgp</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#212121' fontname='Roboto'>False Positives</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#212121' fontname='Roboto'> = (Customers ordering without incentives after block)</run>
                  </formatted-text>
